# The pass dooms an id a capture is publishing: its listing still names the
# old row, so it removes the row the republish is about to refresh and then
# deletes the manifest the republish wrote (#5418). The pass never dooms
# an id a capture holds, so ListedInSink holds: every listed backup's manifest
# is in the sink.
MODULE: BackupRetention
ROW: ListedInSink
FILE: src/lattice.backup/BackupSchedulerGrain.Holds.cs
DETECTORS: BackupRepublishHoldTests.A_pass_never_dooms_a_backup_a_capture_is_republishing
SUMMARY: a retention pass dooms the id of a backup a capture is republishing

--- FIND
        _publishing.Contains(backupId)
        || _retiring.Contains(backupId)
--- REPLACE
        _retiring.Contains(backupId)
--- END
